    "title": "Kan. woman in double-fatal crash is taken for competency evaluation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago SEDGWICK COUNTY —A judge decided Tuesday that a Kansas woman accused in a double fatal crash will have a competency evaluation. The case involving 80-year-old Clowie Ann McLaughlin of Augusta, was taken off the court docket while she completes a competency evaluation, according to the Sedgwick County District attorney's office. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
